1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,410
It's you !

25
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,090
Fellow cultivators, stop !

26
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,210
Explode !

27
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,290
Today,

28
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,970
you won't escape me !

29
00:02:35,810 --> 00:02:37,490
Red Butterfly's cultivation is too high

30
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:40,080
and she displays such a strong killing intent.

31
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,450
If I want to survive

32
00:02:41,950 --> 00:02:43,400
I must also attack.

33
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:45,450
Wang Lin's
Restriction Spear

34
00:02:48,090 --> 00:02:50,010
Ceng Niu's is Early stage Soul Formation,

35
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,490
how can he display such strength !?

36
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:54,570
Red Butterfly,

37
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,930
you didn't send your parents off.

38
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,970
You are unfilial !

39
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:05,210
He actually knows how to break her Dao Heart,

40
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,410
that's unexpected.

41
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,690
For one selfish desire,

42
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,250
you destroyed the Four Sect Alliance.

43
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,490
You are heartless !

44
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,450
You...

45
00:03:16,010 --> 00:03:18,650
You tried to kill me without any reason.

46
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,010
That is unjust !

47
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,530
Xue Yue still exists

48
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,800
yet you sold yourself to Suzaku.

49
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,610
You are unfaithful !

50
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:34,210
You are unfilial, unjust, and unfaithful !

51
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,290
What kind of Dao are you cultivating ?!

52
00:04:18,210 --> 00:04:20,330
Even when all the stars align,

53
00:04:20,810 --> 00:04:22,970
I still can't even touch her.

54
00:04:23,050 --> 00:04:24,530
You are the first one

55
00:04:24,450 --> 00:04:26,850
who forced me to use my life artifact.

56
00:04:26,930 --> 00:04:28,770
You can rest in peace now !

57
00:04:28,970 --> 00:04:29,970
Stop !

58
00:04:29,850 --> 00:04:30,890
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

59
00:04:30,650 --> 00:04:31,450
Brother Ceng,

60
00:04:31,850 --> 00:04:34,050
I was the one who invited you here.

61
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:35,490
If you both continue,

62
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:37,410
then don't blame me for being ruthless !

63
00:04:38,210 --> 00:04:39,530
Fellow cultivator Chi Hu,

64
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,530
I'm not the one who started all this.

65
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,370
This has nothing to do with you.

66
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,330
Back down !

67
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:47,650
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

68
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:50,130
both of you are my guests.

69
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:51,890
If you insist on continuing to attack,

70
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,650
then that means you’re hostile towards me !

71
00:04:54,650 --> 00:04:57,330
I will stand with Brother Ceng and fight back.

72
00:04:57,230 --> 00:04:59,130
And if I make it back alive,

73
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:59,770
Chi Hu's
Origin Soul

74
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:02,290
I’ll definitely report this to Xi Zu !

75
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:03,650
Divine Retribution !

76
00:05:18,090 --> 00:05:18,810
Okay.

77
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,410
Chi Hu,

78
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,010
for the sake of our relation,

79
00:05:22,050 --> 00:05:23,770
I won’t kill this person today.

80
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,890
But the celestial jade coffin

81
00:05:24,890 --> 00:05:26,010
must be mine.

82
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,610
Red Butterfly,

83
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:31,610
do you really think

84
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,530
that I can't kill you ?

85
00:05:33,420 --> 00:05:36,490
I only need to send out this restriction in my hand

86
00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:38,690
and this fragment will collapse.

87
00:05:38,610 --> 00:05:40,410
Do you believe me ?

88
00:05:44,050 --> 00:05:44,930
Brother Ceng,

89
00:05:45,210 --> 00:05:46,930
I’ll make the decision.

90
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,090
Everything we obtain

91
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:49,810
will be split equally between us.

92
00:05:49,730 --> 00:05:50,610
How is that ?

93
00:05:54,770 --> 00:05:55,850
Good,

94
00:05:56,290 --> 00:05:58,570
I leave it to Brother Chi Hu then.

95
00:06:01,090 --> 00:06:02,170
Ceng Niu,

96
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,250
when we return to planet Suzaku,

97
00:06:04,620 --> 00:06:06,330
do you dare to fight me ?

98
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:07,650
I'm willing.

99
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:19,490
Ting'er,

100
00:06:19,690 --> 00:06:20,770
look,

101
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,650
Ting'er

102
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:22,890
we are home.

103
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,490
It has been 1000 years

104
00:06:30,410 --> 00:06:32,410
and you are still so beautiful.

105
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:34,610
Your body was preserved

106
00:06:34,690 --> 00:06:36,730
thanks to the celestial jades I gathered.

107
00:06:36,770 --> 00:06:38,610
You kept your beautiful appearance.

108
00:06:39,450 --> 00:06:41,130
I will definitely find

109
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:43,610
more celestial jades for you.

110
00:06:44,290 --> 00:06:46,930
People say I'm a crazy, disgusting,

111
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:48,770
corpse-loving maniac.

112
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:51,170
They don't understand

113
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:54,250
that it is fate that I met you in the Celestial Realm.

114
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:56,820
Who cares if they say I'm crazy.

115
00:06:56,610 --> 00:06:58,890
I don't regret it.

116
00:07:00,090 --> 00:07:01,170
Don't be afraid.

117
00:07:01,850 --> 00:07:04,170
Your husband will always protect you.

118
00:07:06,690 --> 00:07:08,160
will die.

119
00:07:04,650 --> 00:07:06,250
Anyone that opposes us,

120
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:08,780
Celestial Jade Pagoda

121
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:23,410
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly's ice sculpture really is amazing,

122
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,490
I admire you.

123
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,490
This fragment

124
00:07:26,330 --> 00:07:28,810
is the coldest of the Celestial Realm.

125
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:29,010
Central Cold Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

126
00:07:28,690 --> 00:07:30,210
Without fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

127
00:07:30,250 --> 00:07:32,810
we couldn't have crossed those lands of ice.

128
00:07:34,210 --> 00:07:35,970
Even if it is beyond this obstacle,

129
00:07:36,250 --> 00:07:38,210
why hasn't anyone else

130
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:40,770
found the location in the jade ?

131
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:42,960
To tell you the truth,

132
00:07:42,770 --> 00:07:44,610
the reason I'm so confident

133
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:48,110
is because that fragment cannot be accessed through the vortex.

134
00:07:48,570 --> 00:07:51,170
It's a very rare case of fragments overlapping.

135
00:07:51,250 --> 00:07:53,330
Even teleportation formations are useless there.

136
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:57,410
How did Xi Zu find it back then ?

137
00:07:58,010 --> 00:08:00,450
This involves my clan's secrets,

138
00:08:00,730 --> 00:08:02,530
I can’t tell you.

139
00:08:04,810 --> 00:08:06,770
After traversing this cold fragment,

140
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:09,130
we will have to go through the void.

141
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,370
After the void,

142
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:13,130
we will reach the overlapping fragment.

143
00:08:22,690 --> 00:08:24,090
I have done my job,

144
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,290
this is the end of the fragment.

145
00:08:25,370 --> 00:08:26,890
My spiritual energy has ran out.

146
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,170
From now on,

147
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:30,170
I won't act anymore.

148
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,730
Don't worry fellow cultivator,

149
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,170
you can count on us now.

150
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,960
You have spent a lot of spiritual energy these past 3 days

151
00:08:36,730 --> 00:08:38,330
so you should get some rest.

152
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,170
Even if she ran out of spiritual energy,

153
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,570
she can just take a pill to recover it.

154
00:08:43,850 --> 00:08:46,250
She clearly is luring me into attacking her.

155
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:49,010
If I could reach Middle stage Soul Formation,

156
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:52,090
my domain would evolve

157
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,010
and I would be able to defeat her.

158
00:08:54,290 --> 00:08:56,170
100 years to Soul Formation,

159
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,650
she might be a genius

160
00:08:57,970 --> 00:09:00,370
but her cultivation must be unstable.

161
00:09:03,530 --> 00:09:05,050
The Giant Demon Clan's treasure,

162
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,290
the star compass ?

163
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:10,850
Fake Star Compass

164
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,290
In Tu Si's memory,

165
00:09:09,330 --> 00:09:11,570
I have the method to craft such a star compass.

166
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:14,530
It's a pity most of the materials are extinct

167
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,890
so it's almost impossible to use.

168
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,650
If it were a real star compass,

169
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:22,570
I would not be able to control it with my cultivation.

170
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:25,330
This one is just an imitation

171
00:09:25,570 --> 00:09:28,730
so it's not as effective as a real one.

172
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,250
Red Butterfly,

173
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:33,650
please go to the west side of the compass, under the defensive barrier.

174
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,610
That way you can safely recover your spiritual energy.

175
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,010
I promise you that

176
00:09:38,050 --> 00:09:39,490
nothing will bother you

177
00:09:39,450 --> 00:09:41,090
during this trip through the void.

178
00:09:45,170 --> 00:09:46,210
Brother Ceng,

179
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,810
I need you to control the eastern side.

180
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,050
In this void,

181
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,930
there are many unknown entities.

182
00:09:53,170 --> 00:09:55,810
You need to use those souls of yours to scout

183
00:09:55,610 --> 00:09:57,290
and if you encounter anything,

184
00:09:57,210 --> 00:09:59,250
tell me so I can avoid it.

185
00:09:59,170 --> 00:10:00,330
In this void,

186
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:02,650
you must not spread your Divine Sense

187
00:10:02,610 --> 00:10:05,290
because doing so will bring about disaster.

188
00:10:05,490 --> 00:10:07,090
This is something

189
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:09,210
Ancestor Xi Zu told me.

190
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,610
Brother Chi Hu,

191
00:10:18,250 --> 00:10:19,730
this compass

192
00:10:19,610 --> 00:10:21,500
is meant to be operated

193
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,330
by at least 5 people.

194
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:25,890
Correct !

195
00:10:25,850 --> 00:10:27,570
But there aren't enough treasures

196
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,210
to divide between 5 people.

197
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,610
Brother Ceng,

198
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:31,970
if this compass

199
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,450
breaks in the void,

200
00:10:33,530 --> 00:10:35,450
none of us will survive.

201
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:38,970
I must focus all of my attention on controlling the compass

202
00:10:39,450 --> 00:10:41,570
so it will all depend on Brother Ceng.

203
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:56,370
Void
Rain Celestial Realm

204
00:10:58,450 --> 00:11:01,170
There's something 10 li ahead.

205
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:07,730
Hurry up ! Let's go !

206
00:11:38,450 --> 00:11:40,450
Thank you Brother Ceng for the early warning.

207
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,570
Without you,

208
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,810
the three of us

209
00:11:42,770 --> 00:11:44,770
would have died there.

210
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:46,210
What kind of beast was that ?

211
00:11:46,770 --> 00:11:48,130
I have no idea

212
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:51,120
but something that can live inside the void of the Celestial Realm

213
00:11:50,890 --> 00:11:53,130
is not something we can handle.

214
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,810
This beast is called Xu.

215
00:11:56,170 --> 00:11:58,290
This Xu is considered a minor destructive beast.

216
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:00,650
It is born from devouring the earth

217
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:02,170
Xu

218
00:12:00,490 --> 00:12:02,770
and lives by feeding off Yin energy.

219
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,210
Even during ancient times,

220
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,370
the ancient cultivators

221
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:08,380
would need many people

222
00:12:08,330 --> 00:12:09,730
to defeat it.

223
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,810
Brother Ceng is really knowledgeable,

224
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:13,050
I admire you.

225
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,130
Who knows if what he said is real ?

226
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,930
Don't make up a random name.

227
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,370
Ignorant.

228
00:12:19,450 --> 00:12:20,330
You !

229
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,890
This beast only spreads its tentacles

230
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:25,370
when it's looking for food.

231
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:28,090
When this beast hunts,

232
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:30,210
it spreads out a red aura.

233
00:12:30,450 --> 00:12:32,210
It's not something we can resist.

234
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:35,690
Brother Hu,

235
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,850
quickly fly north !

236
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,810
But...

237
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:40,490
if we got further north,

238
00:12:40,330 --> 00:12:42,410
we will be even more lost in the void.

239
00:12:42,890 --> 00:12:44,570
I don't believe him,

240
00:12:44,890 --> 00:12:46,850
if we continue north here,

241
00:12:47,210 --> 00:12:49,810
our future will be uncertain.

242
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:52,370
It's pointless to talk about this !

243
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:53,930
Brother Ceng !

244
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:56,170
It's fine that he left.

245
00:12:56,170 --> 00:12:57,410
I don't believe

246
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:59,370
that he recognized that creature.

247
00:13:01,290 --> 00:13:03,410
Brother Ceng was right...

248
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:09,050
Had I listened to Brother Ceng,

249
00:13:08,930 --> 00:13:10,570
this wouldn't have happened.

250
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:12,970
Go faster !

251
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,450
Red Butterfly, do something !

252
00:13:54,050 --> 00:13:55,130
Red Butterfly !

253
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,490
The lost petals

254
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,610
can be recovered via cultivation.

255
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:17,410
But I only have 5 stamens...

256
00:14:17,610 --> 00:14:19,770
I will never be able to get it back !

257
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,010
Brother Ceng,

258
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:33,850
sit down so we can talk.

259
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,570
Brother Ceng,

260
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:38,010
I know I was wrong before,

261
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:39,050
I apologize for my mistake.

262
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,490
Is there anything else the beast will do ?

263
00:14:41,930 --> 00:14:44,730
How can we choose our direction after this ?

264
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:47,030
Since we've escaped the red aura,

265
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:49,290
there shouldn’t be any issues for now.

266
00:14:49,370 --> 00:14:51,250
Brother Chi Hu should follow the map

267
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,090
and try to get back on track.

268
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:55,890
Okay.

269
00:14:58,400 --> 00:15:00,090
The star compass has been damaged...

270
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:02,330
It won't last long in this condition.

271
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,250
We need to speed up.

272
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,930
From now on,

273
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:08,450
I need to completely rely on him.

274
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:22,610
10 days later

275
00:15:27,290 --> 00:15:29,650
We've been through a lot in the past 10 days.

276
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:30,610
Thank you, Brother Ceng.

277
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,250
You're welcome.

278
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:34,090
I have also gained a lot from

279
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:36,010
our discussions about the Dao.

280
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:41,210
The Giant Demon Clan isn't native to planet Suzaku.

281
00:15:41,290 --> 00:15:42,610
My ancestors moved there

282
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:44,090
thousands of years ago.

283
00:15:43,990 --> 00:15:46,490
It's natural that our techniques

284
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,090
are somewhat different.

285
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:49,930
That's...

286
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:51,210
Golden Purple Stone

287
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,250
Brother Chi Hu,

288
00:15:52,290 --> 00:15:53,450
please wait a moment.

289
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:57,450
This stone is used to refine star compasses.

290
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:59,290
In order to leave planet Suzaku,

291
00:15:59,410 --> 00:16:01,410
I will need my own star compass.

292
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:17,290
Void near the first layer of
the overlapping fragments
Rain Celestial Realm

293
00:16:19,170 --> 00:16:21,610
We were waiting on the star compass for you to come back

294
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:23,250
but it began to shake violently

295
00:16:23,450 --> 00:16:26,370
and a strong force threw us off of it.

296
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:28,050
In Tu Si's memory,

297
00:16:28,210 --> 00:16:30,010
I have a way to repair it.

298
00:16:29,850 --> 00:16:31,690
The star compass is badly damaged,

299
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:32,610
it's unusable.

300
00:16:32,610 --> 00:16:34,530
It cannot help us fly anymore.

301
00:16:35,970 --> 00:16:38,410
The three of us will have to rely on ourselves.

302
00:16:38,410 --> 00:16:39,690
In 3 days,

303
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,450
we should arrive at the fragment.

304
00:16:46,970 --> 00:16:49,650
I feel like we are being followed.

305
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:56,610
3 days later

306
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:00,130
This is it,

307
00:17:00,010 --> 00:17:01,290
this is the place.

308
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:04,330
Xi Zu once described the first layer to me.

309
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,090
Brother Chi Hu,

310
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,010
since the location on the jade

311
00:17:08,170 --> 00:17:10,090
seems to be on another layer,

312
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:12,090
which layer is it on ?

313
00:17:12,330 --> 00:17:13,370
Useless question.

314
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,930
Of course it's on the second layer.

315
00:17:15,490 --> 00:17:19,130
It is already very unlikely for fragments to overlap once.

316
00:17:19,890 --> 00:17:21,050
Ignorant.

317
00:17:22,930 --> 00:17:23,890
Brother Ceng,

318
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,170
it's on the second layer.

319
00:17:25,610 --> 00:17:27,770
But my ancestor Xi Zu once speculated

320
00:17:27,650 --> 00:17:30,530
that there might be a third layer below.

321
00:17:33,570 --> 00:17:35,010
Let's move, follow me.

322
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:45,610
Ting'er,

323
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:46,490
don't worry.

324
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,970
There must be more celestial jades on the third layer.

325
00:18:05,730 --> 00:18:06,530
This...

326
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:09,410
Second layer of the
overlapping fragments
Rain Celestial Realm

327
00:18:09,850 --> 00:18:12,050
Was Xi Zu mistaken ?

328
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:14,890
Where are the coffin and the celestial swords ?

329
00:18:15,210 --> 00:18:16,970
How could they have vanished ?

330
00:18:17,610 --> 00:18:19,570
Is this the place you were talking about ?!

331
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,910
If you don’t give me a proper explanation,

332
00:18:21,690 --> 00:18:23,210
I won't let this go !

333
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:28,490
Chi Hu doesn't seem to be lying.

334
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:31,090
Something's wrong here.

335
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:32,770
Instead of arguing, why don't

336
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,410
we do something ?

337
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,930
You two,

338
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,450
I was too reckless.

339
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:40,330
I didn't expect that...

340
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:41,460
You were reckless ?

341
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:44,210
Will saying that help me recover my lost stamen !?

342
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:45,730
If you don't explain yourself,

343
00:18:45,970 --> 00:18:49,050
then don’t blame me for not caring about our clans’ relationship.

344
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,290
Once we return to planet Suzaku,

345
00:18:51,370 --> 00:18:53,010
I'll give you a proper explanation.

346
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:55,730
I, Chi Hu, am the young master of the Giant Demon Clan.

347
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:57,690
Although I can’t match you,

348
00:18:57,930 --> 00:19:00,050
I’m a man of my word.

349
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:01,530
Brother Chi Hu,

350
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:04,010
you said before that there might be a third layer.

351
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:05,170
I think that...

352
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,810
I have found the entrance.

353
00:19:25,010 --> 00:19:27,570
Five Elements Sect's Zhou Yi ?!

354
00:19:46,670 --> 00:19:53,600
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

355
00:19:53,420 --> 00:19:59,760
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

356
00:19:59,620 --> 00:20:03,700
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

357
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:07,630
and like many other unseparable things.

358
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:13,640
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

359
00:20:14,570 --> 00:20:20,650
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

360
00:20:20,710 --> 00:20:26,500
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

361
00:20:26,710 --> 00:20:31,180
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

362
00:20:31,190 --> 00:20:34,670
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

363
00:20:34,590 --> 00:20:40,660
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

364
00:20:40,930 --> 00:20:44,860
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

365
00:20:44,710 --> 00:20:48,780
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

366
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:54,630
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

367
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:58,560
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

368
00:20:58,520 --> 00:21:02,340
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

369
00:21:02,210 --> 00:21:08,380
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

370
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:12,460
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

371
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:16,280
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

372
00:21:16,620 --> 00:21:22,110
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

373
00:21:21,930 --> 00:21:26,060
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

374
00:21:25,850 --> 00:21:29,900
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

375
00:21:29,950 --> 00:21:35,760
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

376
00:21:36,150 --> 00:21:42,620
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers
while prosperity sprouts in summer.

377
00:21:42,670 --> 00:21:49,420
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,
the law of cause and effect.

378
00:21:50,190 --> 00:21:56,140
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.

379
00:21:56,060 --> 00:22:03,010
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.
Reincarnation is not to be feared.
